{"3633800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Post-Fire Revenge", "steam_appid": 3633800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633800/extras/9bc5ab2654f6530f4cd3fcef95a5b9c7.avif?t=1787028375\" width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Post-Fire Revenge</strong> is a fast-paced, stylish <strong>third-person 3D character action game</strong> set in a beautiful yet lonely world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as Riven, a broken warrior consumed by guilt and trauma. Chain devastating light and heavy attacks, perfectly time your dodges and blocks, and shatter enemy guards with powerful charged strikes. Adapt your combat style on the fly with explosive long-range sword projectiles and brutal close-quarters combos.<br><br><strong>Post-Fire Revenge</strong> take a place in a world where technology has not advanced much, there exists a type of strange entities that grow with humans, called cores. These <strong>cores</strong> carry innate properties from birth, such as fire, water, darkness, energy, and other elements and traits that later evolve according to the user. These cores can synchronize with specially crafted tools to achieve various effects that would be impossible with the user's power alone. In this world, humans have become accustomed to these abilities as naturally as limbs on Earth. Possessing a core begins from childhood, where it appears as a small spherical body that consumes the host's energy to grow and maintain its power. Once the person reaches adulthood, they begin training to use the cores more effectively. In this world, Riven, who was long considered a hero in the eyes of the people, commits a heinous act that makes him no longer recognize what he has become. All he can see now is his ability to burn those who caused this to him. Revenge. Self-restoration. Perseverance. The Post-Fire Revenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Unleash fiery devastation through</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633800/extras/6f9d2431d4e4a622a72e867687baf8a2.avif?t=1787028375\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633800/extras/d0c6293a8eb445165e2053879f6004f1.poster.avif?t=1787028375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633800/extras/d0c6293a8eb445165e2053879f6004f1.webm?t=1787028375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633800/extras/d0c6293a8eb445165e2053879f6004f1.mp4?t=1787028375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633800/extras/8ff3c102a534b4d531319279f0e74027.avif?t=1787028375\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633800/extras/7e7cc7acc6ff0f08fcf1d8b56a07a63a.poster.avif?t=1787028375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633800/extras/7e7cc7acc6ff0f08fcf1d8b56a07a63a.webm?t=1787028375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/